    "privateAuditCurrent先编码/无委托直接比较，有委托才回调authority current后parse/删键/比较；committedPrivate先JSON.parse callee→audit字段→parse receiver，再晚Noble query/id/key原读取。原身份的库存/Role/Camp/privateState/顶层refs/Victory短路与原生命许可仍authority。",
    "Witch opened先写，reset模板先编码后原三live字段；native Seer历史与Guard规则/状态后uses/lastUsedDay，Hunter canShoot先耗，JSON核对后才原committed回调再audit。失败前缀/sameError不退款或补写，paid/current权限不迁入数据owner。",
