    "整checkpoint十一字段仍id/seat/name/role/camp→原Alive getter→私态解码→Victory/Vote/Badge逐次JSON→marks；complete/meta/life验证保持authority。Badge已committed后逐cp先badge串后vote串；RedMoon本族三写后审计；Idiot两期望串→revealed/canVote/weight→核内容→两引用表→双audit均原序。",
